<title>PERU: Peru's Ferreyros mulls ADR placement.</title>
<headline>Peru's Ferreyros mulls ADR placement.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian heavy machine supplier Ferreyros will decide at an upcoming shareholders' meeting whether to seek an American Depositary Receipt (ADR) placement, the Lima stock exchange said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;The company agreed to call an extraordinary shareholders' meeting for January 9 to discuss the subject of ... carrying out all the process necessary for the placement of ADRs in the corresponding foreign stock markets,&quot; the bolsa said in its daily report.</p>
<p>The report did not give more details, and Ferreyros officials were unavailable for comment.</p>
<p>-- Andrew Cawthorne, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
